43,"verseEnd":43,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"And Solomon rested with his fathers and was buried in the city of his father David. And his son Rehoboam reigned in his place.","from":10},{"book":"1KI","chapter":14,"verse":31,"verseEnd":31,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"And Rehoboam rested with his fathers and was buried with them in the City of David; his motherʼs name was Naamah the Ammonite. And his son Abijam reigned in his place.","from":10},{"book":"1KI","chapter":15,"verse":1,"verseEnd":1,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"In the eighteenth year of the reign of Jeroboam son of Nebat, Abijam became king of Judah,","from":10},{"book":"1KI","chapter":15,"verse":6,"verseEnd":6,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"And there was war between the houses of Rehoboam and Jeroboam all the days of Abijamʼs life.","from":10},{"book":"1KI","chapter":15,"verse":8,"verseEnd":8,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"And Abijam rested with his fathers and was buried in the City of David, and his son Asa reigned in his place.","from":10},{"book":"1KI","chapter":15,"verse":24,"verseEnd":24,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"And Asa rested with his fathers and was buried with them in the city of his father David, and his son Jehoshaphat reigned in his place.","from":10},{"book":"1KI","chapter":22,"verse":50,"verseEnd":50,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"And Jehoshaphat rested with his fathers and was buried with them in the city of his father David. And his son Jehoram reigned in his place.","from":11},{"book":"2KI","chapter":8,"verse":24,"verseEnd":24,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"And Jehoram rested with his fathers and was buried with them in the City of David. And his son Ahaziah reigned in his place.","from":11}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"kings-prophets","title":"Kings, prophets and the house of David","people":6},{"id":"royal-line","title":"The royal line: Judah to David to Jesus","people":5},{"id":"exile-prophets","title":"Last kings of Judah and the prophets of the exile","peopl