},{"id":"eliashib-h0475g","name":"Eliashib","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Elioenai","count":1,"firstVerse":24},{"id":"hodaviah-h1938g","name":"Hodaviah","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Elioenai","count":1,"firstVerse":24},{"id":"johanan-h3110i","name":"Johanan","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Elioenai","count":1,"firstVerse":24},{"id":"pelaiah-h6411b","name":"Pelaiah","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Elioenai","count":1,"firstVerse":24}],"places":[],"words":[{"base":"H3142","lemma":"י֥וּשַׁב חֶ֖סֶד","tr":"yu·shav che·sed","gloss":"Jushab-hesed","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":2},{"base":"H5294","lemma":"נְעַרְיָה","tr":"ne·ar·yah","gloss":"Neariah","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":3},{"base":"H6305","lemma":"פְּדָיָהוּ","tr":"pe·da·yah","gloss":"Pedaiah","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":8},{"base":"H0454","lemma":"אֶלְיְהוֹעֵינַי","tr":"el·ye·ho·e·nay","gloss":"Eliehoenai","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":9},{"base":"H7935","lemma":"שְׁכַנְיָהוּ","tr":"she·khan·yah","gloss":"Shecaniah","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":10},{"base":"H2216","lemma":"זְרֻבָּבֶ֫ל","tr":"ze·rub·ba·vel","gloss":"Zerubbabel","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":21},{"base":"H2608","lemma":"חֲנַנְיָ֫הוּ","tr":"cha·nan·yah","gloss":"Hananiah","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":29},{"base":"H8098","lemma":"שְׁמַעְיָ֫הוּ","tr":"she·ma·yah","gloss":"Shemaiah","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":41},{"base":"H3008","lemma":"יִגְאָל","tr":"yig·al","gloss":"Igal","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":3},{"base":"H3359","lemma":"יְקַמְיָה","tr":"ye·qam·yah","gloss":"Jekamiah","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":3}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"EZR","chapter":2,"verse":2,"verseEnd":2,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"accompanied by Zerubbabel, Jeshua, Nehemiah, Seraiah, Reelaiah, Mordecai, Bilshan, Mispar, Bigvai, Rehum, and Baanah. This is the count of the men of Israel:","from":19},{"book":"EZR","chapter":3,"verse":2,"verseEnd":2,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Then Jeshua son of Jozadak and his fellow priests, along with Zerubbabel son of Shealtiel and his associates, began to build the altar of the God of Israel to sacrifice burnt offerings on it, as it is written in the Law of Moses the man of God.","from":17},{"book":"EZR","chapter":3,"verse":2,"verseEnd":2,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Then Jeshua son of Jozadak and his fellow priests, along with Zerubbabel son of Shealtiel and his associates, began to build the altar of the God of Israel to sacrifice burnt offerings on it, as it is written in the Law of Moses the man of God.","from":19},{"book":"EZR","chapter":3,"verse":8,"verseEnd":8,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"In the second month of the second year after they had arrived at the house of God in Jerusalem, Zerubbabel son of Shealtiel, Jeshua son of Jozadak, and the rest of their associates including the priests, the Levites, and all who had returned to Jerusalem from the captivity, began the work. They appointed Levites twenty years of age or older to supervise the construction of the house of the LORD.","from":17},{"book":"EZR","chapter":5,"verse":2,"verseEnd":2,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Then Zerubbabel son of Shealtiel and Jeshua son of Jozadak rose up and began to rebuild the house of God in Jerusalem. And the prophets of God were with them, helping them.","from":17},{"book":"EZR","chapter":8,"verse":2,"verseEnd":2,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"from the descendants of Phinehas, Gershom; from the descendants of Ithamar, Daniel; from the descendants of David, Hattush","from":22},{"book":"NEH","chapter":10,"verse":22,"verseEnd":22,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Pelatiah, Hanan, Anaiah,","from":21},{"book":"HAG","chapter":1,"verse":12,"verseEnd":14,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Then Zerubbabel son of Shealtiel and Joshua son of Jehozadak, the high priest, as well as all the remnant of the people, obeyed the voice of the LORD their God and the words of the prophet Haggai, because the LORD their God had sent him. So the people feared the LORD. Haggai, the messenger of the LORD, delivered the message of the LORD to the people: “I am with you,” declares the LORD. So the LORD stirred the spirit of Zerubbabel son of Shealtiel, governor of Judah, and the spirit of Joshua son of Jehozadak, the high priest, as well as the spirit of all the remnant of the people. And they came and began the work on the house of the LORD of Hosts, their God,","from":19}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"royal-line","title":"The royal line: Judah to David to Jesus","people":3},{"id":"persian-era","title":"Persian era: Esther and the return","people":2}]}}